          "git_sha": "45397900e8605aa62cab7dcf083e1408cce80389",
          "line_end": 24,
          "line_start": 13,
          "path": "docs/acp-rpc-mapping.md",
          "repository": "rokoss21/iosm-cli",
          "url": "https://github.com/rokoss21/iosm-cli/blob/6cb971ca9c23266d83bb86597c381dd83b2ace0d/docs/acp-rpc-mapping.md#L13-L24"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_f1933d4af8a3396f224e981b4b1a18e73ac934ca0b105d9be42126d869df87ac"
      ],
      "text": "ACP methods map to internal runtime actions: session start/prompt/steer/follow_up/abort/state, builtin slash command dispatch, resumable shell exec sessions with stdin writes, and permission bridge responses supporting scope=once|turn|session."
    },
    {
