        "slc_88ab14a71382daf03ddd201e6fcae58c8eda1a8a5f6d17759446c26ce66c0e54"
      ],
      "text": "A sandbox.enabled setting (default false) enables a Linux bubblewrap sandbox for process-based tools."
    },
