      ],
      "text": "Profiles control behavior and available tools: full grants all built-ins, plan is a read-only bundle, iosm adds IOSM cycle context, and meta is orchestration-first for multi-agent delegation; db_run is enabled only in write-capable profiles (full, meta, iosm)."
    },
