  "summary": "Selected evidence records: The product supports an ACP compatibility mode via --mode acp, with a documented acp.handshake returning protocol version and capabilities including streaming, permissionBridge, toolEvents, sessionLifecycle, backCompatRpc, and execSessions. ACP methods map to internal runtime actions: session start/prompt/steer/follow_up/abort/state, builtin slash command dispatch, resumable shell exec sessions with stdin writes, and permission bridge responses supporting scope=once|turn|session.",
